The Makefile compiles the decoder without SCIM/GTK and builds dict_pinyin.dat
from src/data/rawdict_utf16_65105_freq.txt and src/data/valid_utf16.txt using
the upstream dictionary builder. Native source is not modified. Our bounded
bridge and process-isolation protocol are separate files outside upstream.
The dictionary contains native-size fields; rebuild it for the helper's ABI.

Generated dictionaries, native libraries and executables are not tracked in
git. Distributions of the native helper (with or without a bundled dictionary)
must include this notice and LICENSE. For unbundled distributions, do not claim
to license a separately obtained dictionary; retain its supplier's notices.
